note dl/tests/fstub.om: TEST-ONLY stand-in for server/util.om (contract v1 names), so dl/dl.om can be
note compiled and exercised before the server lands. Never composed into forged.
note Differences from the real util: the storage root and the allow-list come from the test main
note (gtstore, gtan/gtnm/gtrid), tfdata points at /tmp/forge-dltest/data/, frepohd is a marker.
